<title>NETHERLANDS: GELDERSE PAPIER 1996 PROFIT DFL 1.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>GELDERSE PAPIER 1996 PROFIT DFL 1.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     1.8  vs  30.3 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover			     348.2  vs 361.5</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     6.3  vs  13.9 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Gelderse Papier, which is 70 percent</p>
<p>owned by NV Koninklijke KNP BT , said it was too early</p>
<p>to give a forecast for 1997.</p>
<p>    Financial charges		    5.9  vs   6.4</p>
<p>    Tax gain				 1.3  vs   7.0</p>
<p>    Extraordinary charge		 nil  vs  17.0</p>
<p>    Dividend				 nil  vs   nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Gelderse Papier said in January it expected a 1996</p>
<p>net profit of about 1.7 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
